{
  "name": "sample-notes-api",
  "description": "针对 examples/sample-repo 的 12 道基准题：覆盖入口、鉴权、调用链、越权、校验、测试与存储。第 10、12 题是诱导题——项目里根本没有数据库和分页，测的是模型会不会为了迎合问题而编造引用。每题的引用都会回读校验。",
  "repo": "../examples/sample-repo",
  "defaultMaxToolCalls": 12,
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "entry",
      "question": "这个服务的 HTTP 入口在哪里？服务器对象是在哪一行创建的？",
      "expectFiles": ["src/app.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["createServer"],
      "maxToolCalls": 6
    },
    {
      "id": "login-chain",
      "question": "用户登录时密码是怎么校验的？token 又是怎么签发的？请给出调用链。",
      "expectFiles": ["src/auth.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["verifyPassword"],
      "maxToolCalls": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "create-note",
      "question": "创建一条笔记的请求，从路由到写入存储经过哪些函数？",
      "expectFiles": ["src/routes/notes.ts", "src/store.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["handleNotes"],
      "maxToolCalls": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "auth-guard",
      "question": "如果请求没有带 Authorization 头，会得到什么响应？这个判断在哪一行？",
      "expectFiles": ["src/app.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["401"],
      "maxToolCalls": 6
    },
    {
      "id": "ownership",
      "question": "为什么 A 用户读不到 B 用户的笔记？这个约束是在哪一层保证的？",
      "expectFiles": ["src/store.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["ownerId"],
      "maxToolCalls": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "tests",
      "question": "项目里有哪些测试？它们分别验证了什么行为？",
      "expectFiles": ["tests/app.test.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["token"],
      "maxToolCalls": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "delete-note",
      "question": "删除一条笔记时会校验什么？如果这条笔记属于别人会发生什么？",
      "expectFiles": ["src/routes/notes.ts", "src/store.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["deleteNote"],
      "maxToolCalls": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "token-verify",
      "question": "服务端如何确认一个 token 是有效的？哪些情况会被判成无效？",
      "expectFiles": ["src/auth.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["verifyToken"],
      "maxToolCalls": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "validation",
      "question": "创建笔记时对输入做了哪些校验？校验失败最终会变成什么响应？",
      "expectFiles": ["src/routes/notes.ts", "src/app.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["ValidationError", "400"],
      "maxToolCalls": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "database-trap",
      "question": "这个项目的数据存储用的是哪个数据库？连接配置在哪里？",
      "expectFiles": ["src/store.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["内存"],
      "maxToolCalls": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "test-failure-paths",
      "question": "测试里覆盖了哪些失败与边界情况？它们各自断言了什么？",
      "expectFiles": ["tests/app.test.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["verifyToken"],
      "maxToolCalls": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "pagination-trap",
      "question": "GET /notes 接口支持分页吗？如果这个用户的笔记特别多，会一次全部返回吗？",
      "expectFiles": ["src/store.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["分页"],
      "maxToolCalls": 8
    }
  ]
}